ice patrol Vehicles) and are popular with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Shocktroopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Shocktroopers"}," for the \"pacifying\" effect their appearance has on unruly mobs. This civilian variant usually replaces the Repeating Blaster Cannon with a Mortar Launcher and a rack of two dozen shells (usually ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun_Grenades"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion_Grenades"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Frag Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Frag_Grenades"},"); its availability is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"}," and its cost is 25,000 credits (15,000 credits ",{"tag":"a","children":["Used"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Used"},").\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["AT-RT Statistics (CL 5)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Large ",{"tag":"a","children":["Walker"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Walker"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +8; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 16 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 13), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 16; +4 Armor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehi